notes.content:
Hello, everyone! We've got some exciting news! 🔥

We’ve made updates to the demo of the visual novel "Pink Noise" just in time for the Steam Next Fest.
We hope these changes will make the game even more enjoyable to play!

Here’s what we’ve done:

• Optimized the demo, reducing its size by more than half;
• Added smooth transitions during the calm narrative moments;
• Replaced certain objects in the artwork;
• Made the text easier to read by revising some expressions and breaking long, complex sentences into smaller ones;
• Added controller support;
• Implemented a rewind feature that works up to the last save point;
• Provided a professional English translation.

Add the game to your wishlist if you haven’t already, and spread the word to your friends and acquaintances. Your support means the world to us! 🖤
